<title>INDIA: India Flex Engineering 6-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>India Flex Engineering 6-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     100.6  vs  130.2</p>
<p>    Sales		    419.2  vs  483.2</p>
<p>    Other income	    41.6  vs   18.3</p>
<p>    Total expenditure    284.6  vs  347.8</p>
<p>    Interest		  49.9  vs    9.1</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   126.2  vs  144.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    25.7  vs   14.4</p>
<p>    Tax			  nil  vs    nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Flex Engineering Ltd said in a statement that the provision for tax would be considered at the time of annual results.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
